# MetroKit Excel add-in

- Use `@xeokit/xeokit-sdk` `Viewer`, `XKTLoaderPlugin`, `GLTFLoaderPlugin`, `WebIFCLoaderPlugin`, `NavCubePlugin`.
- Keep one Viewer; resize the canvas on window resize; `viewer.destroy()` only on teardown.
- Prefer XKT for large IFC. Parse IFC in-browser only for small files.
- NavCube needs its own canvas (`canvasElement`), not the main viewer canvas.
- The viewer is a content add-in on the sheet (`manifest-content.xml`). Settings are a task pane (`manifest.xml`) that can be shown or hidden.
- Persist settings with `publishSettings` (hidden sheet `MetroKitConfig` and `localStorage`). URL only — no file picker.
- Fetch models as `ArrayBuffer` (CORS). Webpack fallbacks: `fs` and `path` false.
- Excel I/O is optional: guard with `isExcelHost()`. Work in `MetroKit-Excel/`.
